{title: Let Your GLory Fall (Father of Creation)}
{artist: David Ruis}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[C]Father [D]of [G]creation, [C]unfold your [D]sovereign [G]plan
[C]Raise up a [D]chosen [Em]generation, [Am7]That will march through the [Dsus]land   [D]
[C]All of [D]creation is [G]longing, [C]For your [D]unveiling of [G]power
[C]Would you [D]release your [Em]anointing, [Am7]Oh God let this be the [Dsus]hour    [D]

{comment: Chorus}
Let Your [G]glory [D/F#]fall in this [C/E]room, [G]  Let it [C]go fourth from [G/B]here to the [D]nations
Let Your [G]fragrance [D/F#]rest in this [C/E]place, [G]  As we [Am7]gather to [Dsus]seek [D]Your [G]face

{comment: Verse 2}
[C]Ruler [D]of the [G]nations, [C]the world has [D]yet to [G]see,
[C]The full [D]release of Your [Em]promise, [Am7]The church in [Dsus]victory    [D]
[C]Turn to us [D]Lord and [G]touch us, [C]Make us [D]strong in Your [G]might
[C]Over[D]come our [Em]weakness, [Am7]that we can stand up and [Dsus]fight    [D]

{comment: Bridge}
[F]Let Your [C]kingdom [G]come (echo), [F]Let Your [C]will be [G]done(echo)
[F]Let us [C]see on [G]earth (echo), [F]The glory [C]of Your [Dsus]Son
